          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4493-9fa3-8c30-866f">Each time this unit is selected to fight, it can call upon daemonic patrons. If it does, until the end of the phase, each time a model in this unit makes an attack, an unmodified Wound roll of 5+ scores a Critical Wound. At the end of the turn, if this unit called upon daemonic patrons and no enemy models gained damage markers by attacks made by models in this unit this phase, place a damage marker next to this unit.</characteristic>
